1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:03,399 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:06,799 --> 00:00:14,140
Last time, Qiqi and the little prince visited the king.

4
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:22,660
The king controlled everything, but he was all alone. So lonely.

5
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:29,180
Today, they're passing by another very bright planet!

6
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:34,900
The little prince and Qiqi flew and flew, still on their way home.

7
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,660
They passed by a very bright planet.

8
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:41,140
There were so many sparkles everywhere.

9
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:46,859
Wow, did the stars fall down?

10
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:49,539
Qiqi opened her eyes wide.

11
00:00:49,839 --> 00:00:51,659
It wasn't stars at all.

12
00:00:51,959 --> 00:00:54,899
It was a man wearing very shiny clothes.

13
00:00:55,199 --> 00:00:57,099
With a super big hat on his head.

14
00:00:57,399 --> 00:01:00,259
The hat was so bright it was dazzling.

15
00:01:00,559 --> 00:01:02,539
Hello! Do I look handsome?

16
00:01:02,839 --> 00:01:04,579
The man kept asking.

17
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:05,739
Yes, you do.

18
00:01:06,039 --> 00:01:08,819
The little prince answered politely.

19
00:01:09,119 --> 00:01:12,459
Then clap for me! More, more!

20
00:01:12,759 --> 00:01:14,739
The man shouted excitedly.

21
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:17,739
Qiqi curiously tried on that big hat.

22
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:22,819
When she put it on, a big mirror appeared in front of her.

23
00:01:23,119 --> 00:01:25,899
But... the mirror only showed herself.

24
00:01:26,199 --> 00:01:29,479
When Qiqi clapped, only she could hear it.

25
00:01:29,779 --> 00:01:34,179
When Qiqi said "how beautiful," only she answered herself.

26
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,019
Qiqi pouted and took the hat off.

27
00:01:37,319 --> 00:01:41,379
Praising yourself alone is so boring.

28
00:01:41,679 --> 00:01:46,539
I have a rose. I praise her every day, and she praises me too.

29
00:01:46,839 --> 00:01:49,299
When you praise others, they'll praise you back.

30
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:52,699
The man kept looking in the mirror endlessly.

31
00:01:52,999 --> 00:01:55,059
Praise me! Praise me!

32
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:59,739
He shouted loudly. But nobody passed by this planet.

33
00:02:00,039 --> 00:02:05,539
Only looking at yourself... wouldn't that be lonely?

34
00:02:05,839 --> 00:02:10,379
Qiqi whispered to the little prince. The little prince nodded.

35
00:02:10,679 --> 00:02:14,179
They held hands and gently flew away.

36
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:18,939
The man was still shouting — "Do I look handsome?"

37
00:02:19,239 --> 00:02:21,779
But nobody could hear him anymore.

38
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:26,619
Kids, who do you like to praise the most?

39
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:30,019
Go praise your best friend~

40
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:40,299
Next time, Qiqi and the little prince are going to a strange planet.

41
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:52,340
The people there keep drinking something. Why?

42
00:02:52,640 --> 00:03:04,380
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

